title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf sync unlink
catalog: CLI command
target: mf sync unlink
summary: Remove a link (optionally deleting one endpoint record first)

!! Reference

```
Remove a link (optionally deleting one endpoint record first)

Usage: mf sync unlink [OPTIONS] <REPO_A> <REPO_B> <LINK>

Arguments:
  <REPO_A>
          

  <REPO_B>
          

  <LINK>
          The link UUID (from `mf sync status`)

Options:
      --with-endpoint <WITH_ENDPOINT>
          Also delete the endpoint record in `a` (repo_a) or `b` (repo_b)
          
          [possible values: a, b]

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
